    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Snail Quest is a puzzle game based on the 2048 movement mode.</h2><br>When the Player Input the Movement Direction.<br>Every snail will move towards the same direction and only stop when it encounters an obstacle.<br>But when the snails meet each other\uff0cthey will merge into a higher level.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/d6804c5c23550a2dad89016f7d3104c5.poster.avif?t=1656478253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/d6804c5c23550a2dad89016f7d3104c5.webm?t=1656478253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/d6804c5c23550a2dad89016f7d3104c5.mp4?t=1656478253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use the characteristics of snails to reach the designated camp.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/5d53f0ca95906ed9b75237e285d1131f.poster.avif?t=1656478253\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/5d53f0ca95906ed9b75237e285d1131f.webm?t=1656478253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/5d53f0ca95906ed9b75237e285d1131f.mp4?t=1656478253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game now has 40 handcrafted levels\uff0cand there will be another 40 levels of updates in the future.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/c3f44ae710b73d5975660f83480ce43f.avif?t=1656478253\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015740/extras/3d9c12a1eaa3a2fc375f8e4a689d308e.avif?t=1656478253\" /></div><br>Hope you will like it",
